<title>CHINA: SHANGHAI DAZHONG BUYS 250 TAXI LICENSES.</title>
<headline>SHANGHAI DAZHONG BUYS 250 TAXI LICENSES.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Dazhong Taxi Co Ltd on Thursday spent 69.90 million yuan to buy 250 taxi licenses to expand its core business, company general manager Yang Guoping said.</p>
</text>
